                                            {
                                                "example_id": "053a1aa9-b99b-49e9-ac86-9a3920c2e8eb",
                                                "sense_id": "fe9dc5bd-0a0b-37b2-a2dd-7d09984592fa",
                                                "text": "2003, John Wallace, in comp.os.vms http://groups.google.com/group/comp.os.vms/msg/ce77d22d1295d23f?dmode=source&hl=en\nCPQ UK's order management stuff (which I *think* covers Europe) *was* in the process of being Bangalored."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6de5370-5c3a-4ac9-8fec-3907b9c403c3",
                                                "sense_id": "fe9dc5bd-0a0b-37b2-a2dd-7d09984592fa",
                                                "text": "2004, Christopher Browne, in tor.jobs http://groups.google.com/group/tor.jobs/msg/15ded27663ed52bc?dmode=source&hl=en\nThey have gotten gored more heavily by being \"Bangalored\" than they perhaps deserved, but a \"great fall\" was certainly in the cards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "190a450d-9293-4a7a-951f-b172869d88c7",
                                                "sense_id": "fe9dc5bd-0a0b-37b2-a2dd-7d09984592fa",
                                                "text": "2005, Dr.Sahib.Pandit.Shri.Shri.Rainam Ji Maharaj Ji Ustad, in soc.culture.indian http://groups.google.com/group/soc.culture.indian/msg/f44afa71b51ada83?dmode=source\nEven though your anger against Indians is justified given that you have been Bangalored by our sambhar-guzzling desi geeks Swami and Murty - who earn 1/5th your salary and ride to work on their pet elephant *Appu*, it is not fair of you to berate any and every Indian you come across."
                                            }
                                        ]
